@startuml IATI Message Queue Service and Connected Apps
scale 2000*1600

skinparam noteFontSize 10

!include <azure/AzureCommon>
!include <azure/Compute/AzureFunction>
!include <azure/Containers/AzureContainerInstance>
!include <azure/Integration/AzureServiceBus>
!include <azure/Databases/AzureDatabaseForPostgreSQL>
!include <azure/Storage/AzureBlobStorage>


AzureServiceBus(IATIMessageQueueService, "\nIATI Message Queue Service", "iati-mq-INSTANCE")

AzureContainerInstance(BulkDataServiceApp, "\nBulk Data Service App\n(Data Getter)", "bulk-data-service-INSTANCE")

AzureFunction(DataDownloader, "\nData Downloader", "")

AzureBlobStorage(BulkDataServiceWebsite, "\nBulk Data Service Website", "bulk-data.iatistadnard.org")

AzureDatabaseForPostgreSQL(BDSPersistentStorage, "Bulk Data Service Persistent Data Storage", "")

component SuiteCRM

component Dashboard

note right of SuiteCRM
Connections from an app to the Message Queue Service are denoted by edges that begin either with **publish:** or **consume:**. The edge description lists the action type and the <<""topic"">> or <<""subscription"">> name (without the instance postfix).
end note


SuiteCRM -down-> IATIMessageQueueService : **publish**:\n<<""iati-mq-registry-changes-topic"">>\nDATASET_CREATED,\nDATASET_UPDATED,\nDATASET_DELETED,\n\nREPORTING_ORG_CREATED,\nREPORTING_ORG_UPDATED,\nREPORTING_ORG_DELETED

Dashboard --( IATIMessageQueueService : **consume**:\n<<""iati-mq-registry-changes-sub-dashboard"">>\nDATASET_CREATED,\nDATASET_UPDATED,\nDATASET_DELETED,\n\nREPORTING_ORG_CREATED,\nREPORTING_ORG_UPDATED,\nREPORTING_ORG_DELETED

Dashboard --( IATIMessageQueueService : **consume**:\n<<""iati-mq-dataset-check-result-sub-dashboard"">>\nDATASET_CHECK_RESULT

BulkDataServiceApp --> IATIMessageQueueService : **publish**:\n<<""iati-mq-downloader-queue"">>\n<<""iati-mq-downloader-high-priority-queue"">>\nDOWNLOAD_REQUIRED

BulkDataServiceApp --> IATIMessageQueueService : **publish**:\n<<""iati-mq-dataset-check-result-topic"">>\nDATASET_CHECK_RESULT

BulkDataServiceApp -up--( IATIMessageQueueService : **consume**:\n<<""iati-mq-registry-changes-sub-data-getter"">>\nDATASET_CREATED,\nDATASET_UPDATED,\nDATASET_DELETED,\n\nREPORTING_ORG_CREATED,\nREPORTING_ORG_UPDATED,\nREPORTING_ORG_DELETED

BulkDataServiceApp --( IATIMessageQueueService : **consume**:\n<<""iati-mq-download-results-sub-data-getter"">>\nDOWNLOAD_ATTEMPT_RESULT

BulkDataServiceApp --> BulkDataServiceWebsite : upload bulk ZIP

BulkDataServiceApp <--> BDSPersistentStorage : save state

DataDownloader --( IATIMessageQueueService : **consume**:\n<<""iati-mq-downloader-queue"">>\n<<""iati-mq-downloader-high-priority-queue"">>\nDOWNLOAD_REQUIRED

DataDownloader -> IATIMessageQueueService : **publish**:\n<<""iati-mq-download-results-topic"">>\nDOWNLOAD_ATTEMPT_RESULT

DataDownloader --> BulkDataServiceWebsite : upload individual\nIATI datasets\n(XML and ZIP)

@enduml
